  <p id="c-liangshu-021-wangtai-wangyun:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-liangshu-021-wangtai-wangyun:p001:m0000" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEBAA">王泰</persName>字<persName id="c-liangshu-021-wangtai-wangyun:p001:m0003" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEBAA">仲通</persName>，<persName id="c-liangshu-021-wangtai-wangyun:p001:m0006" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEBC">志</persName>長兄<persName id="c-liangshu-021-wangtai-wangyun:p001:m0009" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEBA">慈</persName>之子也。<persName id="c-liangshu-021-wangtai-wangyun:p001:m0014" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEBA">慈</persName>，齊時歷侍中、吳郡，知名在<persName id="c-liangshu-021-wangtai-wangyun:p001:m0028" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEBC">志</persName>右。</p>
